=== {{SlayerTier|1}} ===
*'''Immolate''' - The Inferno Demonlord shoots fireballs to its target rapidly, only dealing {{stat|Knockback}}. When the boss is alive, it deals {{stat|true_dmg}} depending on its health if players fighting it goes into its aggro range.
*'''Demonsplit''' - The boss splits into demons at 50% HP (1,250,000), named Quazii and Typhoeus (a Wither Skeleton and a Pigman appearance respectively). Upon spawning, only Quazii can be damaged. Typhoeus will be immune. Quazii will behave more aggressively, whereas Typhoeus, while immune, will be repelled by the player when within 5 blocks of them. When Quazii is defeated, Typhoeus will adopt more aggressive behavior and can be attacked. When Typhoeus is defeated, the Demonlord reforms and resumes attacking.

=== {{SlayerTier|2}} ===

*'''Hellion Shield''' - The boss has 99% Damage reduction from all sources. Only direct strikes from Blaze Slayer Daggers ([[Twilight Dagger]], [[Firedust Dagger]], [[Kindlebane Dagger]], [[Mawdredge Dagger]], [[Pyrochaos Dagger]], [[Deathripper Dagger]]) attuned identically to the attunement of the boss's shield, enchantment damage from those strikes will ignore the shield and deal full damage to the boss. This excludes {{stat|fero}}, so {{stat|fero}} upgrades are ineffective. Every 8 strikes with the correct attunement, the shield will change its attunement, in order of {{Gray|Ashen}} > {{White|Spirit}} > {{Yellow|Auric}} > {{Aqua|Crystal}} then it goes back to {{Gray|Ashen}}. '''All''' other attacks have their damage reduced by aforementioned 99%. 
**'''Enchantment damage is not mitigated, with the exception of [[Venomous]]. [[Thunderlord]], [[Crimson Armor|Crimson Swipes]], and [[Fire Aspect]] deal their full damage through Hellion Shield.''' 
*'''Demonsplit''' - The Demonlord splits into its demons once at 50% HP (5,000,000). The demons behave as before, but now also have shields, which similarly to Demonlord change every 8 hits. Quazii will alternate only between {{White|Spirit}} and {{Aqua|Crystal}}, while Typhoeus alternates only between {{Gray|Ashen}} and {{Yellow|Auric}}. When a shield switches, the immunity between Quazii and Typhoeus also switches. Regardless the immunity, both demons walks towards their target, but whoever gets the immunity keeps walking and retreating within a 5 block radius of the target. For example, when Quazii is spawned with {{White|Spirit}} and is hit correspondingly 8 times, Quazii becomes immune to damage, leaves and Typhoeus grants {{Gray|Ashen}}. Once Typhoeus is hit correspondingly 8 times, Typhoeus becomes immune to damage, leaves and Quazii grants {{Aqua|Crystal}}. This process goes on until the demons are both defeated and the Inferno Demonlord reforms and resumes attacking.
*'''Fire Pillars''' - Beginning at 50% HP, every 20 seconds, the boss will prepare a fireball above its head for 3.5 seconds. Then, it will throw it in a random direction, where a 4-block high orange pillar will form. Such pillars must be destroyed within 7 seconds of being placed. The pillar has no invincibility frames. The pillar gets 1 block shorter every two times it is hit until at 8 hits, it is no longer present. If it is not destroyed, all players fighting the Demonlord will take {{Red|1000 × Max}} {{Stat|hp}} as {{Stat|True damage}}. This can be blocked by using the [[Wither Cloak Sword]] and [[Mithril Coat]]'s abilities. 

=== {{SlayerTier|3}} ===
*'''Demonsplit''' - The Demonlord splits into its demons twice, at 2/3 HP and 1/3 HP.
**'''ROFLcopter''' - Quazii gains a beam which spins slowly and is centered on Quazii's hitbox. If the player touches the beam, they will deal {{Stat|True damage|1,500}}, and Quazii will heal 20% of its health (1,000,000 hp at {{SlayerTier|III}}, and 2,000,000 hp at {{SlayerTier|IV}}).
*'''Fire Pillars''' - Fire pillars begin at 2/3 HP (30,000,000).
*'''DDR Apocalypse''' - Beginning at 1/3 HP (15,000,000), the boss will spawn up to 5 fire pits near the player regularly. Orange terracotta blocks will form in small cross shapes near the player, which turn to fire after 1.5 seconds. The fire deals {{Stat|True damage|950}} per second. Note that fire pits spawn immediately before the demons spawn, as well as immediately after.

=== {{SlayerTier|4}} ===
The Demonlord functions identically to previous tiers.

*'''Demonsplit''' - It splits into its demons twice, at 2/3 HP (100,000,000) and 1/3 HP (50,000,000).
**'''Trail of Fire''' - Typhoeus gains a trail of fire following it. The fire deals {{Stat|True damage|1,350}} if contact is made.
*'''Fire Pillars''' - Fire pillars begin spawning at 2/3 HP (100,000,000).
*'''DDR Apocalypse''' - At 1/3 HP (50,000,000), the boss spawns up to 5 fire pits near the player at regular intervals though it deals {{Stat|True damage|2,865}} per second.

